{"about_the_game":"Step into the paws of brave and mischievous <strong>RATS</strong> in this charming action-adventure game from Tavern Rat Studios. Set within the nooks and crannies of a typical neighborhood and bustling community, &quot;Mischief&quot; brings back the magic of co-op gaming with a modern twist. <br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886190/extras/BossBattle.gif?t=1744916193\" /><br><strong> Exciting Co-op Challenges</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Team up with up to four players in local multiplayer mode.<br></li><li>Face imaginative household bosses like <i>Shovul: Scourge of the Sandbox</i> and <i>Oscar: Pup of the Pit.</i><br></li><li>Use everyday objects like crayons and ketchup creatively to interact with foes.</li></ul><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886190/extras/bonuslevels.gif?t=1744916193\" /><br><strong> Fun and Diverse Minigames</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"> <li> Engage in an intricate platforming challenge that tests your agility.<br></li><li> Navigate a tricky race course designed for competitive fun.<br></li><li> Compete in a shooting gallery to showcase your precision and skill.<br></li><li> &amp; More Coming Soon!!!</li></ul><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886190/extras/adventuremode.gif?t=1744916193\" /><br><strong> Engaging Exploration and Rewards</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Explore vibrant, detailed environments from a rat\u2019s perspective.<br></li><li>Solve a variety of puzzles that require teamwork and creativity.<br></li><li>Earn over 100 unique achievements to celebrate your accomplishments.</li></ul><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886190/extras/help.gif?t=1744916193\" /><br><strong>Immerse Yourself in the World of Mischief</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Enjoy detailed, hand-crafted 3D art that brings the world to life.<br></li><li>Listen to a delightful, immersive soundtrack that sets the mood.<br></li><li>Join our community for updates, tips, and shared adventures.</li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2886190?t=1744916193","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2886190?t=1744916193","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886190/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744916193","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886190/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744916193","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play on TV","id":43},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"Step into the paws of brave and mischievous <strong>RATS</strong> in this charming action-adventure game from Tavern Rat Studios. Set within the nooks and crannies of a typical neighborhood and bustling community, &quot;Mischief&quot; brings back the magic of co-op gaming with a modern twist. <br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886190/extras/BossBattle.gif?t=1744916193\" /><br><strong> Exciting Co-op Challenges</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Team up with up to four players in local multiplayer mode.<br></li><li>Face imaginative household bosses like <i>Sh